  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: <size=24>- 6 or more
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: <size=24>symbols triggers the Lock & Merge Re-Spin Bonus.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_3
    value: <size=20>- When triggered, the initial number of
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_4
    value: <size=20>symbols determines the number of bonus spins.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_5
    value: <size=20>- All initial
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_6
    value: <size=20>symbols get locked into position, while remaining spots spin
      independently.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_7
    value: <size=24>- During the bonus, all additional
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_8
    value: '<size=24>symbols also get locked in place. '
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_9
    value: <size=24>symbols adjacent to each other get merged then locked in place.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_10
    value: <size=20>- Up to 3
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_11
    value: <size=20>symbols, only vertical merging happens. For more than 3 adjacent
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_12
    value: '<size=20>symbols, '
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_13
    value: <size=20>they merge to create the biggest possible          , in the order
      of 15, 12, 10, 9, 8, 6, or 4 sizes big.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_14
    value: <size=20>- Award pay depending on the size of the merged
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_15
    value: <size=20>. Merging of 4 or more
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_16
    value: <size=20>triggers
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_17
    value: <size=20>the vertical Wheel bonus.
