  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: '<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games.

      - During Free
      Games, 3 or more Scatters re-triggers Free Games.

      - Free Games has the
      Random Multiplier Wild Feature. '
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_2
    value: "<size=20>- During Free Games, randomly apply a Multiplier to each Wild
      that appears.\r\n- Range of random Multipliers applied depends on the total
      number of Wilds on the reel set. \r\n\r\n- If 1 Wild on the reel set, Multiplier
      will be chosen within the range of X2~X10.\r\n- If 2 Wilds on the reel set,
      each Multiplier will be chosen within the range of X4~X20.\r\n- If 3 Wilds
      on the reel set, each Multiplier will be chosen within the range of X8~X30.\r\n-
      If 4 Wilds on the reel set, each Multiplier will be chosen within the range
      of X15~X40.\r\n- If 5 Wilds on the reel set, each Multiplier will be chosen
      within the range of X20~X100.\r\n- Multiplier Wilds in the same Line Win are
      summed then applied towards the pay."
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
